      "value": "@{5baf399abb31bc0c4678b21f|full_name} I see that as a UI/Design problem, if you mean the slots are assigned to people. And hard to fit into the current Group permissions system. But maybe I'm doubting VRChat's ambition there. -- Think about a discord server as an analogy. There are not any permissions or roles that you can only assign to a limited number of people. AFAIK…\n\nAnd the current way bypass works is not that there are \"bypass slots\" free above the cap. There are just certain, and very limited, contexts where someone can bypass.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
